flowchart TD
    A[Observed miss] --> B{Was the task clear?}
    B -->|No| C[Task failure]
    B -->|Yes| D{Was required context available and used correctly?}
    D -->|No| E[Context failure]
    D -->|Yes| F{Were instructions explicit?}
    F -->|No| G[Prompt failure]
    F -->|Yes| H{Did the model follow them?}
    H -->|No| I[Model failure]
    H -->|Yes| J{Was the source or tool adequate?}
    J -->|No| K[Tool or source failure]
    J -->|Yes| L{Was the result checked?}
    L -->|No| M[Review failure]
    L -->|Yes| N[Investigate remaining cause]